          "content": "artists:\n  - keisuke-matsuda\nstart_date: 2024-07-05\nend_date: 2024-07-09\nhero:\n  image: /images/exhibitions/keisuke-matsuda-2024-07.jpg\n  orientation: landscape\n",
          "byteLength": 161,
